{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program' data-target='computer\/program' data-title='Program'>\r\n\t\t\tProgram\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/program\/reshade' data-target='computer\/program\/reshade' data-title='Reshade'>\r\n\t\t\tReshade\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"That is, D3D8 to D3D9.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":null,"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/program\/reshade\/notes.svg' alt='That is, D3D8 to D3D9.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>That is, D3D8 to D3D9.<\/h2>\n\t<h2>Intercepts calls to graphics library<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>by placing the driver file \u201cd3d&lt;n&gt;.dll \/ opengl.dll\u201d file<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h4>Up\u2019grades\u2019 the calls<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThat is, D3D8 to D3D9.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tBlanket for placing post processing shaders.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tHas depth info.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tActive.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Shows init message \u201cReshade..\u201d at the beginning<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTop left.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>At profile creation<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tImportant to choose the correct graphics library version.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Cannot be edited<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Cannot be edited D3D&lt;n&gt; file is not recreated<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPush permanent places the driver file.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe executable remains untouched.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Empty Reshade.fx file to remove filters<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Removing results in.<\/strong> \u2018effects not found\u2019 error - and the message is stuck.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>#pragma reshade showfps<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFor FPS.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tInstallation.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Manual.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h2>2. Mediator<\/h2>\n\t<h4>1. Linked<\/h4>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Only dll is placed.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h4>2. ReShade.fx is symlinked<\/h4>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>?Per profile?<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h4>2. Permanent<\/h4>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Permanent push.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<ol class=\"list-number content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Not required.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ol>\n\t<h4>3. Places the \u2018ReShade\u2019 directory at the root of the Program<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ReshadeFX.dll placed as &lt;driver:dx&lt;n&gt;|opengl&gt;.dll<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tReshade.fx for configuration.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Mediator<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Can not set profile name<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRename in the ReShade directory at the root.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCan set preset name.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tProfile.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPreset.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/reshade\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/program\/reshade\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/program\/reshade' data-target='computer\/program\/reshade' data-title='Reshade'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Reshade<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}